The NBC Wealth application allows you to:
- consult the details of your portfolios and investment baskets at any time;
- obtain detailed information on stocks, ETFs and mutual funds in the Canadian and American market;
- obtain your account statements and tax slips;
- obtain the contact details of your wealth management advisor and his team;
- personalize your experience viewing investment portfolios.

For self-directed mobile brokerage clients, you will also be able to:
- trade securities on the market at any time and place limit orders;
- transfer funds and make contributions to your registered accounts;
- manage your alerts and watchlists;
- communicate with an agent via secure messaging;
- and this at $0 commission on all stock transactions. No minimum required.

The NBC Wealth application is intended for clients of the National Bank for the National Bank Direct Brokerage (NBDB), National Bank Financial Wealth Management (NBFWM) and Private Banking 1859 (PB1859) divisions.

Who are we?
Founded in 1859, the National Bank of Canada (NBC) provides financial services to individuals, businesses, institutional clients and governments across Canada. We are one of 6 systemically important banks in Canada. A bank on a human scale, which stands out for its audacity, its entrepreneurial culture and its passion for people. National Bank Financial is one of the largest securities brokerage firms in Canada.

